title: '[pallet-delegated-staking] fix: map defensive checked_sub to Underflow on
  release'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    In `release_delegation`, the defensive branch for a failing `checked_sub` on the delegation balance used `ArithmeticError::Overflow`. A failed subtraction here indicates the amount would go negative (underflow), so the error should be `ArithmeticError::Underflow`.

    ## Testing

    `SKIP_WASM_BUILD=1 cargo check -p pallet-delegated-staking --all-features`
crates:
- name: pallet-delegated-staking
  bump: patch
